OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fevening showers in the north quickly
OL,7,Fdying out to leave a mostly clear
OL,8,Fnight. Feeling chilly with isolated
OL,9,Ffrosty patches possible in prone rural
OL,10,Fspots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSunny to start with some
OL,13,Fpatchy cloud bubbling up through the
OL,14,Fmiddle of the day. Feeling chilly
OL,15,Fcompared to recently in a light
OL,16,Fnortherly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
