OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLong
OL,6,Fsunny spells to start Sunday although
OL,7,Fcloud building with isolated light
OL,8,Fshowers possible later. Remaining
OL,9,Fcloudy at times with spots of rain
OL,10,FMonday and Tuesday. Light winds
OL,11,Fthroughout.
